配置自启动：

1. ubuntu系统下面创建文件: /etc/systemd/system/device-agent.service
写入下面内容：
[Unit]
Description=Device Agent Service
After=network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target
StartLimitIntervalSec=0

[Service]
Type=simple
ExecStart=/opt/device-agent/device-agent
WorkingDirectory=/opt/device-agent
Environment=LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/opt/device-agent
Restart=always
RestartSec=30
User=root
Group=root

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target

2.重新加载并启动
sudo systemctl daemon-reload
sudo systemctl enable device-agent.service
sudo systemctl start device-agent.service

3.查看日志
sudo journalctl -u device-agent.service -f

